  "VR bitrate": "VR 码率",
  "Higher bitrate improves detail but needs more wireless bandwidth. Constant keeps your target; Adaptive follows connection capacity.": "较高码率可提升细节，但需要更多无线带宽。固定模式保持目标码率，自适应模式随连接能力调整。",
  "About Dynamic Foveated Streaming": "动态注视点串流说明",
  "Frame input and desktop integration live here. Picture, bitrate and Dynamic Foveated Streaming are in Quick setup.": "此处设置 Frame 输入与桌面集成。画面、码率和动态注视点串流位于快捷设置。",
  "SurfXR syncs resolution, refresh rate and bitrate with the connected headset. The latest edit wins. Resolution or refresh changes are saved; restart SteamVR manually to apply.": "SurfXR 的分辨率、刷新率和码率与已连接的头显双向同步，以最后一次主动修改为准。修改会保存；分辨率或刷新率需手动重启 SteamVR 生效。",
  "Open settings": "打开设置",
  "Exit completely": "完全退出",
  "Desktop streaming service": "桌面串流服务",
  "Start desktop streaming automatically at boot": "开机自动启动桌面串流服务",
  "Starts the service at boot and keeps Dashboard in the tray after you sign in. Requires administrator approval. Use Start service to start now.": "开机启动服务，登录后控制面板驻留托盘。更改需要管理员授权；立即使用请点击“启动服务”。",
  "Service starts automatically, but Dashboard logon startup is missing. Enable the option to repair it.": "服务已设为自动启动，但缺少控制面板的登录启动项。勾选可修复。",
  "Desktop quality is in Quick setup > Picture & performance. Access and audio are in SurfXR features > Desktop streaming. Trust devices in Devices.": "桌面画质位于“快捷设置 → 画面与性能”；访问权限与声音位于“SurfXR 功能 → 桌面串流”。请在设备页信任设备。",
  "Desktop streaming uses its own service. Check Installation for host status.": "桌面串流使用独立服务，请在安装页查看主机状态。",
  "Selecting fixed foveation turns off Dynamic Foveated Streaming. Enabling Dynamic Foveated Streaming turns off fixed foveation; its quality values are retained.": "选择固定注视编码会关闭 SurfXR 动态注视点串流；启用 SurfXR 动态注视点串流会关闭固定注视编码，并保留原来的画质参数。",
  "Saved settings enable both foveation modes. Select one mode to resolve the conflict.": "已保存的设置同时启用了两种注视模式。请选择一种模式以消除冲突。",
  "Use Dynamic Foveated Streaming": "使用 SurfXR 动态注视点串流",
  "Selecting Light / Medium / High disables Dynamic Foveated Streaming and uses upstream center/edge encoding. Enabling Dynamic Foveated Streaming disables fixed foveation while retaining these quality values. SurfXR default disables fixed foveation. Neither mode reduces the game rendering resolution.": "选择轻度、中等或高会关闭 SurfXR 动态注视点串流，使用原版中心/边缘编码。启用 SurfXR 动态注视点串流会关闭固定注视编码，并保留这些画质参数。“SurfXR 默认”关闭固定注视编码。两种模式都不会降低游戏渲染分辨率。",
  "Exit SurfXR?": "退出 SurfXR？",
  "This will close SurfXR and disconnect desktop streaming.": "退出后，SurfXR 将停止后台运行，桌面串流将断开。",
  "SteamVR will also close with Dashboard.": "SteamVR 也将随控制面板一起关闭。",
  "Confirm exit": "确认退出",
  "Startup & diagnostics": "启动与诊断",
  "Dashboard startup": "Dashboard 自启动",
  "Start Dashboard in the tray when I sign in": "登录 Windows 后自动启动 Dashboard 到托盘",
  "Startup options are in Quick setup > Startup & diagnostics.": "自启动选项位于快捷设置 > 启动与诊断。",
  "Warnings by default. Debug enables detailed diagnostic logs. Changes apply immediately.": "默认仅输出警告和错误。选择调试级别可启用详细诊断日志，修改立即生效。",
  "Log level": "日志级别",
  "Log level is in Quick setup > Startup & diagnostics. Detailed events require Debug and Show raw events.": "日志级别位于快捷设置 > 启动与诊断。详细事件需要选择调试并开启显示原始事件。",
  "SurfXR SteamVR driver": "SurfXR SteamVR 驱动",
  "Checking driver registration...": "正在检查驱动注册…",
  "Current Dashboard driver is registered and available.": "当前 Dashboard 对应的驱动已注册，驱动文件存在。",
  "Current Dashboard driver is registered, but its binary is missing.": "当前 Dashboard 对应的驱动已注册，但驱动文件缺失。",
  "Current Dashboard driver is not registered. Register this installation below.": "当前 Dashboard 对应的驱动未注册，请点击下方按钮注册此安装。",
  "All registered SteamVR drivers": "所有已注册的 SteamVR 驱动",
  "4. Installation pairs this Frame with this Dashboard. Choose Desktop or SteamVR on Frame.": "4. 安装会将此 Frame 与当前 Dashboard 配对；完成后在 Frame 选择桌面或 SteamVR。",
  "Copy result": "复制结果",
  "Installation complete. Saving Frame pairing...": "安装完成，正在保存 Frame 配对…",
  "Frame is installed and paired. Choose Desktop or SteamVR on Frame.": "Frame 已安装并配对。请在 Frame 选择桌面或 SteamVR。",
  "Installation completed, but pairing was not confirmed. Retry installation or trust this Frame in Devices.": "安装完成，但未能确认配对。请重试安装，或在设备页信任此 Frame。",
  "Connected (idle)": "已连接（待机）",
  "VR streaming": "VR 串流中",
  "Desktop / unified connections": "桌面与统一串流连接",
  "No desktop or unified device connected": "当前没有桌面或统一串流设备连接",
  "Disconnect session": "断开当前连接",
  "Disconnect ends this connection and keeps pairing. Reconnect from the headset when needed.": "断开只结束当前连接，保留设备配对；需要时可从头显重新连接。",
  "Closing the window keeps streaming in the tray. Fully exiting disconnects all sessions.": "关闭窗口后在托盘继续串流；选择完全退出会断开所有会话。",
  "Dashboard installer adapter is missing. Update the complete PC installation, including frame-installer.": "缺少 Dashboard 安装适配脚本。请完整更新 PC 安装，包括 frame-installer 目录。",
  "Installer returned no diagnostics. Check that frame-installer was updated together with Dashboard; inspect the installer window for startup errors.": "安装器未返回错误详情。请确认 frame-installer 已随 Dashboard 一起更新，并查看安装窗口的启动错误。",
  "Generating command preview locally. No connection to Frame.": "正在本地生成命令预览，不会连接 Frame。",
  "NVIDIA encoder analysis": "NVIDIA 编码分析",
  "Multi pass": "多遍编码（Multi pass）",
  "Single pass (lower latency)": "单遍（更低延迟）",
  "Two passes (quarter resolution)": "四分之一分辨率两遍",
  "Two passes (full resolution, quality)": "全分辨率两遍（画质优先）",
  "Full-resolution two-pass analysis can improve detail within your bitrate budget, with extra encoding time. No filler data is added. NVIDIA only; restart SteamVR after changing this setting.": "全分辨率两遍分析可在目标码率内改善细节，但会增加编码耗时。此选项不添加填充数据，仅对 NVIDIA 编码器生效；更改后需重启 SteamVR。",
  "SurfXR default uses the project's latency-focused encoder setup: CBR; NVENC P1, LowLatency, single pass, Spatial AQ and up to three split engines. Weighted prediction and the NVENC rate-control override are disabled. Other encoders use Speed. Splitting depends on GPU/codec support. Custom preserves your settings. Adjust Multi pass below or other encoder settings in Advanced. Full-resolution two-pass analysis prioritizes detail at additional encoding cost. Codec, bitrate, resolution and refresh rate are selected separately.": "SurfXR 默认采用低延迟编码组合：CBR；NVENC P1、LowLatency、单遍、Spatial AQ，最多三个分割编码引擎。关闭加权预测和 NVENC 码率控制覆盖；其它编码器使用速度优先。分割编码取决于 GPU 和编码格式支持。自定义保留当前设置；可在下方调整多遍编码，其它编码参数位于高级设置。全分辨率两遍优先改善细节，但会增加编码耗时。编码格式、码率、分辨率和刷新率独立设置。",
  "Uninstall Steam Frame client": "卸载 Steam Frame 客户端",
